                      MicroSoft Mouse Menu System for Telix v3.11


The archive should contain the following files:

TLX311M3.ME    -    This file.
MENU.COM       -    MicroSoft Program for installation of        
                    TLX311M3.MNU.

TLX311M3.MNU   -    The program itself in MicroSoft mouse menu   
                    format.
TLX311M3.DOC   -    Documentation for TLX311M3.MNU.
TLX311M3.ODR   -    Order form for this package - please read.

TLX.BAT        -    Sample batch file for start-up of Telix in   
                    conjunction with TMS.

INSTALL.COM    -    Utility from PC Magazine for installation of
                    TLX311M3.MNU.
REMOVE.COM     -    Utility from PC Magazine for removal of      
                    TLX311M3.MNU from memory.

KEY-FAKE.COM   -    Utility from PC Magazine used in TLX.BAT.
KEY-FAKE.DOC   -    Documentation from PC Magazine for           
                    KEY-FAKE.COM.

If MOUSE.COM or MOUSE.SYS is already installed and your mouse is
operational you can start right away by running TELIX.BAT.  If
have a problem or question, please consult the documentation
file.  If that doesn't help, then contact the author by mail at
